#. type: 標題
#: README.md:1
msgid "# OSPO Starter Kit　Draft"
msgstr ""

#. type: 段落
#: README.md:2
msgid "This kit is a collection of templates for establishing an Open Source Program Office (OSPO) in an organization and for building the strategic use of open source together with an appropriate governance structure."
msgstr ""

#. type: 標題
#: README.md:3
msgid "## ⚠️ Development Status and Roadmap"
msgstr ""

#. type: 段落
#: README.md:4
msgid ""
"This kit is currently a **\"draft (incomplete)\"**. Some content is still under consideration or in progress and may change substantially. For the status of updates, see [Releases\n"
"](https://github.com/japan-opensource-hub/ospo-starter-kit/releases)."
msgstr ""

#. type: 標題
#: README.md:5
msgid "## Included Files and Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: 段落
#: README.md:6
msgid "This kit contains the following documents."
msgstr ""

#. type: 標題
#: README.md:7
msgid "### A. OSS Policy (Company-Wide Rules) Templates (`oss-policy-templates/`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: 段落
#: README.md:8
msgid "Templates that collect sample articles to refer to when drafting an internal OSS policy (company-wide rules), together with their background and customization guidance. Each article consists of three sections: \"Sample Article\", \"Commentary\", and \"Customization Perspectives and Operational Notes\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: 清單
#: README.md:9
msgid ""
"- `introduction.md`: Introduction ─ How to Use This Document\n"
"- `articles/00_preamble.md`: Article 0. Preamble\n"
"- `articles/01_purpose.md`: Article 1. Purpose\n"
"- `articles/02_definitions.md`: Article 2. Definitions\n"
"- `articles/03_scope.md`: Article 3. Scope of Application\n"
"- `articles/04_ospo.md`: Article 4. OSPO\n"
"- `articles/05_oss_usage.md`: Article 5. OSS Usage\n"
"- `articles/06_contribution.md`: Article 6. Contribution to OSS Projects\n"
"- `articles/07_oss_release.md`: Article 7. Releasing Company Works as OSS\n"
"- `articles/08_personal_oss_activity.md`: Article 8. Employees' Personal OSS Activities\n"
"- `articles/09_trademark_and_brand.md`: Article 9. Handling of Trademarks and Branding\n"
"- `articles/10_license_violation_incident.md`: Article 10. Response to License Violations and Incidents\n"
"- `articles/11_security_and_vulnerability.md`: Article 11. Security and Vulnerability Management\n"
"- `articles/12_records_and_reporting.md`: Article 12. Records and Reporting\n"
"- `articles/13_education_and_awareness.md`: Article 13. Education and Awareness\n"
"- `articles/14_employment_rules_relation.md`: Article 14. Relation to Employment Regulations\n"
"- `articles/15_revision_and_enforcement.md`: Article 15. Revision and Enforcement"
msgstr ""

#. type: 標題
#: README.md:10
msgid "### B. Operation Templates (`operation-templates/`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: 段落
#: README.md:11
msgid "Document templates to publish on an internal portal (Wiki, SharePoint, and the like) and communicate to the people concerned. Each template carries a \"Customization Checklist\" and a \"Customization Guide\" (inside comments)."
msgstr ""

#. type: 段落
#: README.md:12
msgid "For how to introduce and customize the templates, see `how-to-use-templates-for-ospo.md` (for OSPO staff) and `how-to-use-guide-for-users.md` (for end users)."
msgstr ""

#. type: 清單
#: README.md:13
msgid ""
"- **Fundamentals and Organization** (`about/`)\n"
"  - `opensource-guide.md`: [Company Name] Open Source Guide (entry point)\n"
"  - `about-opensource.md`: About Open Source\n"
"  - `benefits.md`: Benefits of Open Source\n"
"  - `ospo.md`: What Is an OSPO?\n"
"  - `innersource.md`: What Is InnerSource?\n"
"  - `glossary.md`: Glossary"
msgstr ""

#. type: 清單
#: README.md:14
msgid ""
"- **License Compliance** (`compliance/`)\n"
"  - `license-compliance.md`: Open Source License Compliance\n"
"  - `what-is-a-license.md`: What Is a License?\n"
"  - `license-types.md`: Types of Licenses\n"
"  - `source-disclosure-licenses.md`: Licenses with Source Code Disclosure Obligations\n"
"  - `oss-with-commercial-license-options.md`: OSS with Commercial License Options\n"
"  - `license-faq.md`: License FAQ"
msgstr ""

#. type: 清單
#: README.md:15
msgid ""
"- **Practice and OSS Utilization** (`using/`)\n"
"  - `using-oss.md`: Using Open Source\n"
"  - `finding-oss.md`: Finding Open Source Software\n"
"  - `oss-inventory.md`: Approved Internal OSS Inventory\n"
"  - `evaluation.md`: Evaluating Open Source Software\n"
"  - `supplier-procurement.md`: Procuring OSS from Suppliers\n"
"  - `usage-faq.md`: OSS Usage FAQ"
msgstr ""

